flowchart TD
    A[User enters postcode] --> B[(PostgreSQL LOCATION)]

    B --> C{Location exists?}

    C -->|Yes| D[Return existing locations]

    C -->|No| E[External Address Source]

    E --> F[Address Results]

    F --> G[(postcode-geography.db)]

    G --> H[Retrieve Geographic Data]

    H --> I[Combine Address + Geographic Data]

    I --> J[(PostgreSQL LOCATION)]

    J --> D

    D --> K[Display Locations]